+         * validates it before any blocking wait (moduleId "TK" at 0x1E4, the
+         * descriptor quadword at 0x2FB0, the TaskInfo context EA and LS pattern
+         * at 0x2780). Without it inFAMOUS 2's EDGE zlib task got
+         * CELL_SPURS_TASK_ERROR_PERM from its blocking LFQueue pop and died on
